[x] Semaphore signalled for all three (A, B, C waited in that order):
  FIFO, worse (0x30, 0x28, 0x30): MBAC
  FIFO, equal: MABC
  FIFO, better (0x18, 0x10, 0x18): BACM
  FIFO, mixed (0x18, 0x30, 0x20): AMCB
  Priority attr, worse: MBAC
  Priority attr, better: BACM

[x] Semaphore signalled for one:
  FIFO, worse: MB
  Priority attr, worse: MB
  FIFO, better: AM
  Priority attr, better: BM

[x] Event flag satisfying all three:
  FIFO, worse: MBAC
  FIFO, equal: MABC
  FIFO, better: BACM

[x] Woken versus already ready, all at main's priority:
  R started, then W woken: MRW
  W woken, then R started: MWR

[x] Starting threads at main's priority:
  A, B started: MAB

[x] sceKernelRotateThreadReadyQueue:
  A, B ready, main rotates (0): ABM
  A, B ready, main rotates (0x20): ABM
  A, B ready at 0x30, main rotates (0x30): MBA

[x] sceKernelChangeThreadPriority:
  A, B ready, A changed to its own priority: MBA
  A, B ready, main changed to its own priority: ABM
  A ready, main lowers itself to 0x21 and back: AM
  A 0x30, B 0x28, A raised to 0x28: MBA

[x] sceKernelSuspendThread / sceKernelResumeThread:
  A, B ready, A suspended and resumed: MBA

[x] sceKernelReleaseWaitThread:
  R started, then W released: MRW
